## Rich Messages — Bot API 10.1 + 10.2 (June-July 2026)

Telegram rich messages: structured blocks, streaming drafts, AI thinking.
Source: core.telegram.org/bots/api · No llms.txt exists (2026-08-10).

---

## Methods

### sendRichMessage
Send rich formatted messages. Returns Message.
| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| chat_id | Integer/String | Yes | Target chat |
| message_thread_id | Integer | Optional | Forum topic / thread |
| direct_messages_topic_id | Integer | Optional | DM topic; required if DM chat |
| rich_message | InputRichMessage | Yes | The message |
| business_connection_id | String | Optional | Business connection |
| disable_notification | Boolean | Optional | Silent send |
| protect_content | Boolean | Optional | No forward/save |
| allow_paid_broadcast | Boolean | Optional | 1000 msg/s for 0.1 Stars each |
| message_effect_id | String | Optional | Message effect (private only) |
| suggested_post_parameters | SuggestedPostParameters | Optional | DM suggested post |
| reply_parameters | ReplyParameters | Optional | Reply target |
| reply_markup | InlineKeyboardMarkup/ReplyKeyboardMarkup/ReplyKeyboardRemove/ForceReply | Optional | Interface |
| receiver_user_id | Integer | Optional | Ephemeral recipient |
| callback_query_id | String | Optional | Callback query |

### sendRichMessageDraft
Stream partial rich message — 30-second ephemeral preview. Must call sendRichMessage
to persist. Returns True.
| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| chat_id | Integer | Yes | Target private chat |
| message_thread_id | Integer | Optional | Thread |
| draft_id | Integer | Yes | Draft ID; non-zero. Same ID = animated transitions |
| rich_message | InputRichMessage | Yes | Partial message. No direct file upload. |

### sendMessageDraft
Stream partial plain message — 30-second ephemeral preview. Must call sendMessage
to persist. Returns True.
| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| chat_id | Integer | Yes | Target private chat |
| message_thread_id | Integer | Optional | Thread |
| draft_id | Integer | Yes | Draft ID; non-zero. Same ID = animated transitions |
| text | String | Optional | 0-4096 chars. Empty = "Thinking..." placeholder |
| parse_mode | String | Optional | HTML/Markdown |
| entities | Array of MessageEntity | Optional | Custom entities |

### editMessageText (enhanced)
Added: rich_message (InputRichMessage, Optional) — replace text with rich content.

---

## InputRichMessage
Describes a rich message to send. Exactly ONE of: html, markdown, or blocks.
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| blocks | Array of InputRichBlock | Optional. Block composition |
| html | String | Optional. HTML formatted content |
| markdown | String | Optional. Markdown formatted content |
| media | Array of InputRichMessageMedia | Optional. Media for markdown/html (tg://photo?id=, tg://video?id=, tg://audio?id=) |
| is_rtl | Boolean | Optional. Right-to-left |
| skip_entity_detection | Boolean | Optional. Skip auto-detection of URLs, emails, mentions, etc. |

### InputRichMessageMedia
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | String | 1-64 chars [A-Za-z0-9_-]. Used in tg://photo?id=X links |
| media | InputMediaAnimation/InputMediaAudio/InputMediaPhoto/InputMediaVideo/InputMediaVoiceNote | The media |

---

## InputRichBlock (union — 21 types)

### InputRichBlockParagraph
type="paragraph" | text: RichText

### InputRichBlockSectionHeading
type="heading" | text: RichText

### InputRichBlockPreformatted
type="pre" | text: RichText | language: String (Optional)

### InputRichBlockFooter
type="footer" | text: RichText

### InputRichBlockDivider
type="divider" (no fields)

### InputRichBlockMathematicalExpression
type="mathematical_expression" | expression: String (LaTeX)

### InputRichBlockAnchor
type="anchor" | name: String

### InputRichBlockList
type="list" | items: Array of InputRichBlockListItem

### InputRichBlockBlockQuotation
type="blockquote" | blocks: Array of InputRichBlock | credit: RichText (Optional)

### InputRichBlockPullQuotation
type="pullquote" | text: RichText | credit: RichText (Optional)

### InputRichBlockCollage
type="collage" | blocks: Array of InputRichBlock | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockSlideshow
type="slideshow" | blocks: Array of InputRichBlock | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockTable
type="table" | cells: Array of Array of RichBlockTableCell | is_bordered: Boolean (Optional) | is_striped: Boolean (Optional) | caption: RichText (Optional)

### InputRichBlockDetails
type="details" | summary: RichText | blocks: Array of InputRichBlock | is_open: Boolean (Optional)

### InputRichBlockMap
type="map" | location: Location | zoom: Integer (13-20) | width: Integer | height: Integer | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockAnimation
type="animation" | animation: Animation | has_spoiler: Boolean (Optional) | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockAudio
type="audio" | audio: Audio | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockPhoto
type="photo" | photo: Array of PhotoSize | has_spoiler: Boolean (Optional) | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockVideo
type="video" | video: Video | has_spoiler: Boolean (Optional) | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockVoiceNote
type="voice_note" | voice_note: Voice | caption: RichBlockCaption (Optional)

### InputRichBlockThinking
type="thinking" | text: RichText
DRAFT ONLY — cannot appear in persisted messages. See t.me/addemoji/AIActions for recommended emoji.

