## InputRichBlockListItem
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| blocks | Array of InputRichBlock | Content |
| has_checkbox | Boolean | Optional. Checkbox |
| is_checked | Boolean | Optional. Checked |
| value | Integer | Optional. Ordered list numeric value |
| type | String | Optional. Label type: "a" "A" "i" "I" "1" |

---

## RichText (union — 24 types + String + Array)
Can be: a plain String, an Array of RichText, or any of:

### Simple wrappers (type + text: RichText)
- RichTextBold (type="bold")
- RichTextItalic (type="italic")
- RichTextUnderline (type="underline")
- RichTextStrikethrough (type="strikethrough")
- RichTextSpoiler (type="spoiler")
- RichTextSubscript (type="subscript")
- RichTextSuperscript (type="superscript")
- RichTextMarked (type="marked")
- RichTextCode (type="code")

### With extra fields
- RichTextDateTime: type="date_time" | text | unix_time: Integer | date_time_format: String
- RichTextTextMention: type="text_mention" | text | user: User
- RichTextCustomEmoji: type="custom_emoji" | custom_emoji_id: String | alternative_text: String
- RichTextMathematicalExpression: type="mathematical_expression" | expression: String (LaTeX)
- RichTextUrl: type="url" | text | url: String
- RichTextEmailAddress: type="email_address" | text | email_address: String
- RichTextPhoneNumber: type="phone_number" | text | phone_number: String
- RichTextBankCardNumber: type="bank_card_number" | text | bank_card_number: String
- RichTextMention: type="mention" | text | username: String
- RichTextHashtag: type="hashtag" | text | hashtag: String
- RichTextCashtag: type="cashtag" | text | cashtag: String
- RichTextBotCommand: type="bot_command" | text | bot_command: String
- RichTextAnchor: type="anchor" | name: String
- RichTextAnchorLink: type="anchor_link" | text | anchor_name: String (empty = top)
- RichTextReference: type="reference" | text | name: String
- RichTextReferenceLink: type="reference_link" | text | reference_name: String

---

## RichBlock (union — 21 output types, mirrors InputRichBlock)
Same structure as InputRichBlock but received in messages.

### Supporting types

#### RichMessage
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| blocks | Array of RichBlock | Content |
| is_rtl | Boolean | Optional. Right-to-left |

#### RichBlockCaption
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| text | RichText | Caption |
| credit | RichText | Optional. Credit (<cite>) |

#### RichBlockTableCell
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| text | RichText | Optional. Cell text (omit = invisible) |
| is_header | Boolean | Optional. Header cell |
| colspan | Integer | Optional. Column span |
| rowspan | Integer | Optional. Row span |
| align | String | "left" / "center" / "right" |
| valign | String | "top" / "middle" / "bottom" |

#### RichBlockListItem
| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| label | String | Item label |
| blocks | Array of RichBlock | Content |
| has_checkbox | Boolean | Optional |
| is_checked | Boolean | Optional |
| value | Integer | Optional. Ordered list value |
| type | String | Optional. "a" "A" "i" "I" "1" |

