## Ephemeral Messages (related)

### Methods
- editEphemeralMessageText
- editEphemeralMessageMedia
- editEphemeralMessageCaption
- editEphemeralMessageReplyMarkup
- deleteEphemeralMessage

### Fields (on Message)
- receiver_user: User — ephemeral recipient
- ephemeral_message_id: Integer — ID inside chat

### ReplyParameters additions
- ephemeral_message_id: Integer — reply to ephemeral

---

## Streaming pattern for AI bots

1. Receive user message in thread (message_thread_id)
2. Send sendRichMessageDraft with draft_id=N, InputRichBlockThinking
3. As tokens arrive, send sendRichMessageDraft with same draft_id=N,
   blocks accumulating (paragraph, pre, list, etc.)
4. Draft auto-expires after 30s of no updates
5. When complete, call sendRichMessage with final blocks — persists in chat
6. For tool calls: use InputRichBlockDetails (collapsible) to show tool
   input/output, InputRichBlockPreformatted for code

:: ∎
